                            elementNames="description"
                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/cycling-tuscany/cycling-tuscany"
                            paragraphScope="range"
                            text="Cycling Tuscany Tuscany at the speed of a bicycle A car is too fast for Tuscany. On a bike you smell the cypress and the wood smoke, you hear the bells, and you arrive in each hill town hungry enough to do justice to lunch. We ride quiet lanes and the white gravel roads between vineyards, between 40 and 60 kilometres a day, and sleep in farmhouses and small family hotels."
